                                "sense_id": "403c7da9-4940-30ff-8b87-326f63e492dc",
                                "text": "She carried six boats, an unusually large number for a craft of her size; two were surf-boats, I found on inspection; two were uncollapsible lifeboats; one was an ordinary ship's gig, while the other was a small steam launch of excellent build and workmanship."
                            },
                            {
